==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{etymon|ru|:inh|orv:добръ}}
{{inh+|ru|orv|добръ}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*dobrъ}}.

Also related to {{cog|ru|до́ба|t=time}}, {{cog|ru|сдо́ба|t=shortening}}, {{cog|ru|удо́бный|t=comfortable}}, {{cog|ru|до́блесть|t=valour}}, {{cog|lt|dabà||habit, character}}, {{cog|en|daft}}, {{cog|en|deft}}.

